=== ... until DDL on the table, DISCARD PLANS or a reconnection makes the session plan again; ANALYZE of an unchanged table does not ===
ANALYZE t1;
ANALYZE
EXPLAIN (COSTS off) EXECUTE p(100);
                                QUERY PLAN                                 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Finalize Aggregate
   ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
         ->  Partial Aggregate
               ->  Hash Join
                     Hash Cond: (t2.t1_id = t1.id)
                     ->  Seq Scan on t2
                     ->  Hash
                           ->  Broadcast Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
                                 ->  Seq Scan on t1
                                       Filter: (v < $1)
 Optimizer: Postgres-based planner
(11 rows)

